cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this framework, please cite it.
title: "AutoResearch HPC: an auditable protocol for AI-assisted research on HPC"
abstract: >-
  A domain-agnostic framework for AI-assisted research on existing compute
  clusters. It combines atomic iteration claiming, hash-frozen pre-declaration,
  append-only correction, workflow execution, durable evidence and cross-checking
  by a separately configured model family. Cross-checks are treated as evidence,
  not as a scientific truth guarantee.
type: software
license: MIT
